# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Hospital Management System v2.0 — frontend environment (EXAMPLE FILE)
#
# Copy to `.env` for local development:
#     cp .env.example .env
#
# Only VITE_* variables are exposed to the browser bundle, so NEVER put a
# secret here: everything prefixed with VITE_ is public. The frontend never
# needs backend secrets — it authenticates with a JWT obtained at login.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# Base URL of the backend API, including the version prefix.
VITE_API_BASE_URL=http://localhost:4000/api/v1

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# REMOTE PREVIEW / NON-LOCALHOST BROWSER
#
# If the browser opening this app is NOT on the same machine as the API (for
# example a remote preview URL), the absolute URL above would call the viewer's
# own computer. Use a relative base so the dev server proxies the API instead:
#
#     VITE_API_BASE_URL=/api/v1
#
# The Vite dev server forwards /api to http://localhost:4000 (vite.config.ts).
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
